         "step": 1,
         "text": "The volume is \\( V = s^{3} \\), with s the edge length, both depending on time.",
         "rule_named": "relating equation"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Differentiate with respect to time: \\( \\frac{dV}{dt} = 3s^{2} \\frac{ds}{dt} \\).",
